cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use or reuse these training materials, please cite them as below.
title: Cryo-ET and Subtomogram averaging Workshop
abstract: The focus of the workshop is to provide training in some of the most recent developments of CryoET and STA data processing using for instance nextPYP, TomoBEAR, Warp/M, taught by the developers themselves. The workshop provides hands-on training in CryoET and STA encompassing all stages of the pipeline. No previous experience is required. Participants are required to bring their own laptops with mouse to the workshop.
